{"name": "Machine of the Wasteland", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras_big/1a76c7c32817275864a08954b216266d.avif?t=1781154673\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/1a76c7c32817275864a08954b216266d.avif?t=1781154673\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.poster.avif?t=1781154673\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.webm?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/dcc0d0a173fa8b8f63f6fc56af6b2ee9.mp4?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Welcome to Machine of the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Step into the chaos, seize your destiny, and become the King of all Machines!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machine of the Wasteland is a high-octane vehicular combat action game set in a brutal, post-apocalyptic world where survival hinges on your ability to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies. MOW offers a taste of the fast-paced, twin-stick shooter action, as you battle through open arenas with customizable combat vehicles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Top Down Vehicular Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat in Machine of the Wasteland is simple to learn but challenging to master, requiring you to stay constantly on the move to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Test your skills in action-packed battles against enemy vehicles and armored personnel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.poster.avif?t=1781154673\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.webm?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/47fdbe31a70eaa886bb6f6d1e7e7a76e.mp4?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore Open Battle Spaces</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate sprawling arenas designed for high-speed, tactical warfare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The paths may seem straightforward, but hidden secrets and surprises await the keen explorer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.poster.avif?t=1781154673\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.webm?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/792fe414331fa4263fa3f0344713c857.mp4?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge Ruthless Faction Leaders and other Bosses</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Take on powerful enemies leading dangerous factions across the wasteland.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experiment with Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your combat vehicle\u2019s capabilities to match your strategy and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.poster.avif?t=1781154673\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.webm?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/extras/e37690f6420fa1cf89236830f3af9434.mp4?t=1781154673\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rev up your engines. The Wasteland awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "High-octane vehicular combat action game set in a chaotic, post-apocalyptic world where survival hinges on your ability to outmaneuver and outgun your enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387290/header.jpg?t=1781154673", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Racing", "Action-Adventure", "Arcade", "Platformer"], "developers": "Unite Game", "publishers": "Unite Game", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3387290", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zsdSI1MoqYk", "first_seen": 1747267200.0, "review_rank": 1662}